    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks. i checked the fluid and it looks pretty clean, no obvious metal shavings or burnt smell. if it's not a clog or a bad pump, do you think it's more likely a solenoid issue or maybe something internal with the valve body assembly? just trying to narrow down if i need to pull the whole pan or if i can just swap a sensor.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
